        "name": "USN-7839-2",
        "description": "USN-7839-1 fixed vulnerabilities in Go Cryptography. This update provides the corresponding update in the Go Cryptography module included in Google Guest Agent.  Original advisory details:   Damien Tournoud, Patrick Dawkins, Vince Parker, and Jules Duvivier  discovered that Go Cryptography incorrectly handled public keys during SSH  operations. An attacker could possibly use this issue to bypass  authorization mechanisms.",
